Soft-Elo reproduction package
Bora Kargi and David Salinas, 2026

This package includes functions extracted from the authors' OpenJury and
Soft-Elo experiment implementations. OpenJury's Apache License 2.0 is preserved
in LICENSE. The original source paths and hashes are recorded in
softelo_release/core_provenance.json.

Changes for this release: standalone imports, annotation-only data loading,
explicit protocol selection, provenance manifests, validation and cached-table
reconstruction. Numerical source functions retain their original operations.
